y.<\/p>"}},"faq_k3U3zJ":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"How long until I see results?","answer":"<p>Most customers report feeling the jaw workout immediately on first use. Visible jawline definition typically appears within 4–8 weeks of daily use, depending on your starting point, body fat percentage, and consistency.<\/p>"}},"faq_gMMnPE":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"Is the creatine effective through chewing?","answer":"<p>Yes. Creatine monohydrate is absorbed through the mucous membranes in your mouth (buccal absorption) as well as through normal digestion when swallowed with saliva. Each piece delivers a full 500mg dose.<\/p>"}},"faq_hTKgm3":{"type":"faq","settings":{"question":"Shipping & returns","answer":"<p>We ship worldwide. Orders are processed within 1–2 business days. Standard delivery takes 5–8 business days depending on your location. Tracking included with every order.<\/p><p>90-day money-back guarantee. Not satisfied? Reach out and we'll make it right.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["faq_EUhDEd","faq_dgrBAD","faq_gnbWhW","faq_k3U3zJ","faq_gMMnPE","faq_hTKgm3"],"name":"GF FAQ","settings":{"heading":"Frequently Asked Questions","subheading":"","open_first":false,"one_at_a_time":true,"icon_style":"plus","bg_color":"#121212","heading_color":"#f4f4f4","subheading_color":"#666666","title_color":"#f4f4f4","body_color":"#999999","border_color":"#1e1e1e","icon_color":"#2ab5b4","heading_size":34,"padding_top":80,"padding_bottom":80,"padding_top_mobile":48,"padding_bottom_mobile":48,"enable_animations":true}},"gumforce_guarantee_WfF8VQ":{"type":"gumforce-guarantee","blocks":{"detail_YeWdDD":{"type":"detail","settings":{"text":"90-day full refund"}},"detail_znhDQi":{"type":"detail","settings":{"text":"Results guaranteed"}},"detail_Y7yFhb":{"type":"detail","settings":{"text":"No questions asked"}}},"block_order":["detail_YeWdDD","detail_znhDQi","detail_Y7yFhb"],"name":"GF Guarantee","settings":{"layout_centered":true,"badge_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/